  Director of Kelley's Data Science and Artificial Intelligence LabChung-c
 hieh Shan\, Associate Professor\, Luddy School of Informatics\, Computing
 \, and Engineering7:15–8:00 PM  Light ReceptionJOIN THE CONVERSATION  D
 iscover the people and history behind Taiwan's semiconductor transformati
 on and engage with IU specialists from across disciplines for a deeper co
 nversation about technology\, innovation\, and Taiwan's IT sector.Organiz
 ed by  IU Taiwan Studies Initiative  East Asian Studies Center  Taipei Ec
 onomic and Cultural Office (TECO) in Chicago
