 shville for 20 years. She has focused in particular on the intersection o
 f music and technology. She has worked at YouTube and Pandora and\, most 
 recently\, has spent five years at Spotify as the Head of Editorial for N
 ashville\, where she led the team that covers rock and alternative\, coun
 try\, and Christian and gospel music programming. Before working in music
  programming\, she was Director of Digital Marketing at Borman Entertainm
 ent. She currently serves on the board of the Americana Music Association
  and has also served on the boards of the Country Music Association and L
 eadership Music.</p><p>  Come see how exploring your interests in the hum
