 n Life.  The tour complements the day's symposium\, museum reception\, an
 d evening concert by bringing participants into the museum for an opportu
 nity to engage with art and material culture in connection with the broad
 er themes of memory\, cultural heritage\, and artistic interpretation exp
 lored throughout Memory Transformed.Advance registration is required for 
 the guided tour\, and space is limited.  A second guided tour will be off
 ered at 5:00 p.m. Guests should register for only one tour time.  The mus
 eum reception is open to all and does not require participation in a tour
 .
