LOCATION:SIDNEY AND LOIS ESKENAZI MUSEUM OF ART
GEO:39.169144;-86.519739
SUMMARY:Art\, Books\, & Coffee at the Eskenazi Museum of Art
DESCRIPTION:Bring your current read\, settle into the galleries with a cu
 shion\, and enjoy quiet time surrounded by art.  Sip a warm beverage and 
 enjoy a treat from the café\, take part in a book-themed wellness activi
 ty\, and browse the museum's art-inspired Little Free Library.  Whether y
 ou're looking for a peaceful solo outing or a chance to connect with fell
 ow book lovers\, this relaxed evening is the perfect way to spend a fall 
 evening.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Bring your current read\, settle into t
 he galleries with a cushion\, and enjoy quiet time surrounded by art.</p>
 <p>  Sip a warm beverage and enjoy a treat from the café\, take part in 
 a book-themed wellness activity\, and browse the museum's art-inspired Li
 ttle Free Library.</p><p>  Whether you're looking for a peaceful solo out
 ing or a chance to connect with fellow book lovers\, this relaxed evening
  is the perfect way to spend a fall evening.</p>
