 tRun SCXW9873833 BCX8">Indianapolis</span></span><span class="TextRun SCX
 W9873833 BCX8" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span c
 lass="NormalTextRun SCXW9873833 BCX8">. Drawing on memories and influence
 s spanning Tibbetts' life\, the exhibition traces what he describes as a 
 path away from "the commonplace and the ordinary" and toward the wonderfu
 l\, extraordinary\, and terrifying. The exhibition will remain on view th
 roughout October.</span></span></p><p><span class="TextRun SCXW9873833 BC
 X8" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span class="Norma
 lTextRun SCXW9873833 BCX8">Presented as part of Festival451indy.</span></
 span></p><p><span class="TextRun SCXW9873833 BCX8" lang="EN-US" xml:lang=
 "EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW9873833 BCX8"
 >Festival 451indy is sponsored in part by Herbert Simon Family Foundation
  with additional support from Indiana Humanities</span></span></p>
