SUMMARY:Excursions Into the Weird @ Cultural Arts Gallery
DESCRIPTION:"ExcursionsIntothe Weird\," is an exhibition of paintings by 
 artist\, author\, and longtime Bradbury friend John CarterTibbetts\, open
 ing October 1 at the Cultural Arts Galleryat IUIndianapolis. Drawing on m
 emories and influences spanning Tibbetts' life\, the exhibition traces wh
 at he describes as a path away from "the commonplace and the ordinary" an
 d toward the wonderful\, extraordinary\, and terrifying. The exhibition w
 ill remain on view throughout October.Presented as part of Festival451ind
 y.Festival 451indy is sponsored in part by Herbert Simon Family Foundatio
 n with additional support from Indiana Humanities
