BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:IU Arts & Humanities Institute
DTSTART:20261105T180000Z
DTEND:20261105T193000Z
LOCATION:GLOBAL &amp\; INTERNATIONAL STUDIES BUILDING
